<title>UK: German inland gas oil stable, buyers still absent.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil stable, buyers still absent.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.6877)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     34.00/34.30     20.15/20.32   34.20/34.40</p>
<p> BREMEN		34.00/34.30     20.15/20.32   34.20/34.40</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    33.60/34.00     19.91/20.15   33.70/34.10</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   34.00/34.20     20.15/20.26   34.10/34.30</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   33.90/34.10     19.96/20.21   34.00/34.20</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  34.70/35.00     20.56/20.74   34.80/35.10</p>
<p>German inland gas oil was a touch weaker on Monday as dealers tried to entice buyers with lower numbers. &quot;We tried to balance the stronger dollar, but no luck,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
